cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "fts-research: advanced modelling and forecasting of functional time series"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shayeghi
    given-names: Kian
repository-code: "https://github.com/KianShayeghi/fts-research"
abstract: >-
  Research code for scalar-on-function regression where the coefficient function is zero on
  part of its domain: the truncated linear model of Hall and Hooker (2016), the locally
  sparse estimator of Stefanucci, Bernardi and Canale (2025), a FAR(1) process supplying
  serially dependent curves, and a matched-spectrum comparison of the three. Also the
  functional time series forecaster of Shang (2017a), scored against the FAR(1) on identical
  principal components, and a jump equation for the overnight move that forecaster's own
  transform deletes.
keywords:
  - functional data analysis
  - functional time series
  - scalar-on-function regression
  - locally sparse estimation
  - truncated linear model
  - functional principal component analysis
  - forecasting
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
